  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened enabling environment for entrepreneurship and sustainable enterprises to support productivity growth, inclusive recovery and decent work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO contributes to strengthening entrepreneurship and supporting the development of sustainable enterprises in Ukraine by building the skills required to start and expand businesses, while fostering a conducive environment for enterprise development. Support includes entrepreneurship training tools, assistance with business-plan development, grant support and business advisory services to help viable start-ups launch and existing enterprises resume or expand their operations.
At the same time, the ILO supports improvements in labour market conditions and governance to enhance enterprise competitiveness and productivity growth. Through social dialogue and collaboration with government and social partners, support promotes inclusive labour market participation of women, veterans, persons with disabilities and internally displaced persons, while strengthening the ecosystem of institutions and service providers that help SMEs improve productivity, working conditions and compliance with international labour standards. Together, these efforts contribute to job creation, greater economic resilience and a more sustainable and inclusive recovery in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
